{
  "id": "2SA.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samweli 2",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yeemekhwa abe omuruchi waYuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyuma lwamakhuwa ako kosi Daudi yareeba OMWAMI, ari Endikulushe enzinjile mwitaala liosi liaYuda noho? OMWAMI namukalusia mbu Tikulukha. Daudi nareeba ari Nendikulushe ninzia heena? Naye ari E Heberoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Daudi yatikulukha natsiayo, halala nende abakhasibe babili, Ahinoamu omuYezereeli nende Abigaili ousika Nabali omuKarameli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi nende abandube aba yalinji ninabo, Daudi natikulukha ninabo, buli mundu nende abeinzuye, nibamenya mumataala kaHeberoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abandu baYuda nibeetsa, nibamutsushiilila Daudi amafura ebweneyo, mbu abe omuruchi weinzu yaYuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamuboolela Daudi bari Abandu baYabeshi-gileadi nibo abamuyabila Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Daudi yaruma abarume ewabandu baYabeshi-gileadi nabasunjila mbu OMWAMI amuheelesie ikhabi, olwa mwamukholela eshisa shino omwami weenywe, Saulo, nimumuyabila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano OMWAMI amukholele inywe akobuheeli oburalilu nende obwatoto; nasi siesi ndalamurunga obulayi buno, shichila mwakhola likhuwa lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano amakhono keenywe kabe namaani, nimuba abeitswoni; okhuba Saulo omwami weenywe yafwile, abeinzu yaYuda nabo banzushiliile amafura embe omuruchi wabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaseera inzu yaSaulo lihe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Abineri omwana waNeri, omuseesia welihe liaSaulo, yali nabukuule Ishiboshetsi omwana waSaulo namuyila injelekha, eMahanaimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niyamukholile omuruchi waGileadi, khandi wabaAshuru, khandi waYezereeli, khandi waEfuraimu, khandi waBenyamini, nende khuIsiraeli yosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Ishiboshetsi waSaulo yali owe-miyika amakhumi kane olwa yachaaka okhuruka Isiraeli, naruka emiyika chibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neshise shiosi eshia Daudi yali omuruchi weinzu yaYuda muHeberoni, nemiyika musaafu nende emiesi chisasaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Abineri waNeri nende abasumba baIshiboshetsi waSaulo nibarula eMahanaimu nibatsia eGibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoabu waZeruya nende abasumba baDaudi nibarula nibababukaanila ahambi nende litiba liaGibeoni; nibeekhala, abandi elubeka luno Iwelitiba, nabandi elubeka lulia Iwelitiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Abineri namusunjila Yoabu ari Chama abasooliili bano babuushe babaye imbeli weefwe. Yoabu nasunga mbu Babuushe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibabuukha, nibaambukha, obukhumi bwabwe shinga olwa bwali; mbu ekhumi nababili baBenyamini nende Ishiboshetsi waSaulo, khandi ekhumi nababili abokhubasumba baDaudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibatiilana buli mundu nowashie omurwe, nibafumirana mumbafunindio bakwa bosi halala. Khulwako habundu tsana halangwa mbu Helekatsihasurimu, naho hali muGibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lihe liali lilulu muno inyanga eyo; naye Abineri yahulwa, nende abandu baIsiraeli, imbeli wabaamba baDaudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abasiani baZeruya bataru bali nibaliho, mbu Yoabu, nende Abishai, nende Asaheli; naye Asaheli yali omwangu muno ebilenjebie shinga eshitsusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Asaheli yalondachilila Abineri; ne mukhutsiakhwe shiyakotola khumukhono musaatsa kata khumukhasi tawe, mukhulondachilila Abineri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Abineri nakhupa amashemo inyuma, nasunga mbu Khane niwe, Asaheli? Nakalusia mbu Nisie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abineri namusunjila ari Kotola khumukhonokwo musaatsa, kata khumukhono mukhasi, ohambe oundi khubasooliili, obukule ebiyaayo bibie. Habula Asaheli shiyafuchiilila okhwibera mukhumulonda tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abineri namusunjila Asaheli khandi, ari Wibere oleshe okhunonda; nishiina eshiakhachila ndakhuupa hasi? Ndakhanyala endie okhuchinguula obweni bwanje imbeli waYoabu omusiani weenywe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa yaloba okhwiberakho mana Abineri namuupa munda nende injela yelifumo, lifumo nilirulila emukongo; naye nakwaho, nafwila habwene yaho. Ne buli mundu owoola habundu yaho ewa Asaheli yakwa nafwa, yeemaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula Yoabu nende Abishai bamulondachilila Abineri; eliuba niliyeela olwa bali nibakhoola khulukulu lwaAma, oluhengazne nende Gia, khunjila yeshitsiimi shiaGibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaBenyamini nabo nibakhung'aana halala inyuma waAbineri, nibeekhola ing'anda ndala, nibasinjila hekulu wolukulu lundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Abineri nalanga Yoabu, namusunjila ari Olukanga lulaliitsanga obushia nobushia noho? Shiomanyile mbu obumaliilishi bulaba obululu? Nolinde okhuula liina, kho obiile abandu bakalushe baleshe okhulondachila abaana babwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoabu nasunga mbu Shinga Nyasaye olwa abeesangaho mwoyo, olaba noraboolile ta, khane mutsuli abandu bakheenyooshe, nibaralondachila buli mundu omwana wabwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yoabu yakhupa olwika, abandu bosi nibeema, nibaralondachilila Isiraeli khandi ta, kata okhuseerana khandi tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
